{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["And I will break the pride of your might — as written: ״בשברי לכם מטה לחם״. And as written: ״גאון שבעת לחם היה לה״. And in the aggadah: it is the Temple, as written: ״הנני מחלל את מקדשי גאון עזכם״. And according to the plain sense: as I explained, for thus the end of the verse proves it: ״ונתתי את שמיכם״ and so forth."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:25.857315787Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}